      en: ["Best-preserved woodland in Montegiardino", "Dominated by Turkey and downy oaks", "Key habitat for local badger populations", "Spring blooms of snowdrops and anemones", "Protective function against soil erosion", "Vital carbon sink in the smallest municipality"],
      es: ["El bosque tiene 100 hectáreas.", "Fue protegido en 1985.", "La altitud está entre 400 y 600 metros.", "Habitantes: ciervos, jabalíes, pájaros carpinteros.", "El sendero natural mide 5 km.", "2.000 visitantes anuales."],
